方式，歡迎來電洽詢。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: black;\">6、該刊登物件位置為591系統自動定位、有可能有誤差，以案件實際位置</span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、公園綠地、學校。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "蘆洲區民族路446號", "lat": "25.0919820", "lng": "121.4725460", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "仁愛街口[新巴士]站", "distance": 16, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約16公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "仁愛街口站", "distance": 27, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約27公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "民族民義街口站", "distance": 169, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約169公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "夾零食", "distance": 576, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約576公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "碳烤鹹酥雞", "distance": 13, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約13公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "university", "name": "輔大大学", "distance": 730, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約730公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立蘆洲國民中學", "distance": 816, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約816公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "14,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "電費", "value": "臺電繳費", "key": "electricFee"}, {"name": "服務費", "value": "半個月租金", "key": "serviceFee"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "管理費、水費、網路", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "住家用", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "7坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "24年", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "有", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "隔間材料", "value": "水泥磚牆", "key": "spacematerial", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢程度", "value": "高檔裝潢", "key": "decorate", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢時間", "value":